-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3.5 text-success absolute inset-0 transition-all duration-200 opacity-0 scale-50 blur-[2px]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Copy Markdown</button><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_4b9iin55_" data-state="closed" class="inline-flex items-center h-8 px-3 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-surface1 border border-surface3 text-neutral1 hover:bg-surface2 transition-colors gap-2">Open in...<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-3.5 text-neutral2 transition-transform duration-200 [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div><h1 class="text-[1.75em] font-semibold !font-medium mb-2">Uniswap Protocols Overview</h1><p class="mb-8 text-lg text-fd-muted-foreground">Navigate the Uniswap protocol documentation, from the core AMM versions to supporting infrastructure contracts.</p><div class="prose flex-1"><h2 id="protocols" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#protocols" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Protocols</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h2>
<p>Uniswap is a suite of onchain protocols. At its core are the automated market maker (AMM) contracts, the pool contracts that hold liquidity and execute swaps. Surrounding them are supporting protocols that handle routing, token approvals, resource locking, smart wallet delegation, and fee distribution.</p>
<p>This page helps you orient within the protocol documentation and find the right starting point for your integration.</p>
<h3 id="amm-protocols" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#amm-protocols" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">AMM Protocols</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The AMM is the heart of Uniswap. Each version introduced architectural changes that improved capital efficiency, composability, and gas costs. <strong class="font-semibold">Uniswap v4 is the current and recommended version for new integrations.</strong></p>
<h3 id="uniswap-v4" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#uniswap-v4" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Uniswap v4</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>v4 consolidates all pools into a single <code>PoolManager</code> contract and introduces <a href="/docs/get-started/concepts/hooks" data-discover="true">hooks</a>, external contracts that can customize pool behavior at every stage of its lifecycle (initialization, swaps, liquidity changes, fee logic). It uses <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/flash-accounting" data-discover="true">flash accounting</a> to defer token transfers until the end of a transaction, enabling significant gas savings for multi-step operations.</p>
<p>v4 is the most flexible and gas-efficient version of the protocol. If you are building a new integration, start here.</p>
<div class="relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6"><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left">Resource</th><th style="text-align:left">Link</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left">Concepts</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/hooks" data-discover="true">Hooks</a>, <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/flash-accounting" data-discover="true">Flash Accounting</a>, <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/dynamic-fees" data-discover="true">Dynamic Fees</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left">Guides</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="/docs/protocols/v4/guides/hooks/getting-started" data-discover="true">Set Up Environment</a>, <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/guides/hooks/your-first-hook" data-discover="true">Build Your First Hook</a>, <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/security" data-discover="true">Security Framework</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left">SDK</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="/docs/sdks/v4/overview" data-discover="true">Uniswap v4 SDK docs</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left">Deployments</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="/docs/protocols/v4/deployments" data-discover="true">Uniswap v4 addresses</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left">Repositories</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">v4-core</a>, <a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-periphery" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">v4-periphery</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left">Audits</td><td style="text-align:left"><a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/tree/main/docs/security/audits" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">Core audits</a>, <a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-periphery/tree/main/audits" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">Periphery audits</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h3 id="other-amm-versions" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#other-amm-versions" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Other AMM Versions</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<div class="flex flex-row gap-4 mt-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:flex-1"><a href="/docs/protocols/v3/overview" class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-12 border-none px-6 py-4 font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 no-underline !text-neutral1 bg-surface2 hover:bg-surface3"><span>Uniswap v3</span><span class="text-sm font-normal opacity-70">Concentrated liquidity with NFT positions. Use for existing integrations and v3-specific workflows.</span></a><a href="/docs/protocols/v2/overview" class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-12 border-none px-6 py-4 font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 no-underline !text-neutral1 bg-surface2 hover:bg-surface3"><span>Uniswap v2</span><span class="text-sm font-normal opacity-70">Original constant-product AMM. Good for fundamentals and legacy integrations.</span></a></div>
<h2 id="supporting-protocols" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#supporting-protocols" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Supporting Protocols</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h2>
<p>Beyond the AMM, Uniswap relies on a set of infrastructure contracts that handle routing, approvals, fee distribution, and more. These protocols are used across multiple AMM versions and are important for production integrations.</p>
<h3 id="universal-router" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#universal-router" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Universal Router</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The Universal Router is an unowned, non-upgradeable contract that composes swaps across Uniswap v2, Uniswap v3, and Uniswap v4 in a single transaction. It uses a command-based encoding system and integrates with Permit2 for signature-controlled token approvals.</p>
<p>If you are executing swaps programmatically, the Universal Router is the recommended entry point.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/protocols/universal-router/overview" data-discover="true">Universal Router documentation</a></p>
<h3 id="permit2" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#permit2" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Permit2</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Permit2 unifies signature-based token transfers and time-bound allowances into a single contract. It is used by the Universal Router, the <code>PositionManager</code>, and other Uniswap contracts to reduce repeated approval transactions and improve security.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/protocols/permit2/overview" data-discover="true">Permit2 documentation</a></p>
<h4 id="protocol-fees" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#protocol-fees" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Protocol Fees</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h4>
<p><a href="/docs/get-started/concepts/fees#protocol-fees">Fees</a> from all Uniswap protocol versions flow through Fee Adapter contracts into a per-chain TokenJar. Releaser contracts define how collected fees are accessed, for example, the Firepit Releaser burns UNI in exchange for collected assets.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/protocols/protocol-fee/overview" data-discover="true">Protocol Fees documentation</a></p>
<h3 id="the-compact" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#the-compact" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">The Compact</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The Compact is an ownerless ERC-6909 contract that enables <a href="/docs/protocols/the-compact/concepts/resource-locks" data-discover="true">resource locks</a>, tokens that are credibly committed for asynchronous conditions and claimed once those conditions are met. It supports single-chain and multichain flows and is used in cross-chain coordination.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/protocols/the-compact/overview" data-discover="true">The Compact documentation</a></p>
<h3 id="smart-wallet-calibur" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#smart-wallet-calibur" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Smart wallet (Calibur)</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Uniswap smart wallet features are powered by Calibur, a non-upgradeable contract implementation for EIP-7702 delegation. Users delegate to the implementation while keeping their existing EOA address.</p>
<p><a href="/docs/protocols/smart-wallet/overview" data-discover="true">Smart Wallet documentation</a></p>
<h2 id="security" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#security" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">Security</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h2>
<p>Uniswap Labs maintains an active bug bounty program on Cantina for eligible vulnerability disclosures.</p>
<p><a href="https://cantina.xyz/bounties/f9df94db-c7b1-434b-bb06-d1360abdd1be" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">Uniswap Bug Bounty Program</a></p>
<h2 id="faq" class="flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center"><span class="group/heading-anchor inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1 -ml-1"><a href="#faq" class="min-w-0 text-inherit">FAQ</a><button type="button" class="shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-sm text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/heading-anchor:opacity-100 hover:text-fd-foreground focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-primary/40" aria-label="Copy link to section"><span class="relative flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link absolute inset-0 size-3.5 transition-all duration-200 scale-100 opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check absolute inset-0 size-3.5 text-success transition-all duration-200 scale-75 opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></button></span></h2>
<details><summary>Which Uniswap protocol version should I use for a new integration?</summary><div class="ms-4"><p>Uniswap v4 is the current and recommended version for new integrations. It consolidates all pools into a single <code>PoolManager</code> contract, supports <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/hooks" data-discover="true">hooks</a> that customize pool behavior across the pool lifecycle, and uses <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/concepts/flash-accounting" data-discover="true">flash accounting</a> to defer token transfers until the end of a transaction, which reduces gas for multi-step operations.</p><p>Use <a href="/docs/protocols/v3/overview" data-discover="true">Uniswap v3</a> for existing concentrated liquidity integrations and <a href="/docs/protocols/v2/overview" data-discover="true">Uniswap v2</a> for legacy constant product workflows.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>What is the difference between the Uniswap AMM and its supporting protocols?</summary><div class="ms-4"><p>The AMM contracts are the pool contracts that hold liquidity and execute swaps, versioned as Uniswap v2, v3, and v4. The supporting protocols are infrastructure contracts used across versions:</p><ul>
<li><a href="/docs/protocols/universal-router/overview" data-discover="true">Universal Router</a>: composes swaps across v2, v3, and v4 in a single transaction.</li>
<li><a href="/docs/protocols/permit2/overview" data-discover="true">Permit2</a>: signature-based token transfers and time-bound allowances.</li>
<li><a href="/docs/protocols/protocol-fee/overview" data-discover="true">Protocol Fees</a>: Fee Adapter and TokenJar contracts that collect protocol fees.</li>
<li><a href="/docs/protocols/the-compact/overview" data-discover="true">The Compact</a>: ERC-6909 resource locks for cross-chain coordination.</li>
<li><a href="/docs/protocols/smart-wallet/overview" data-discover="true">Smart wallet (Calibur)</a>: EIP-7702 delegation for smart wallet features.</li>
</ul></div></details>
<details><summary>Which contract should I use to execute Uniswap swaps programmatically?</summary><div class="ms-4"><p>The <a href="/docs/protocols/universal-router/overview" data-discover="true">Universal Router</a> is the recommended entry point for executing swaps programmatically. It is an unowned, non-upgradeable contract that composes swaps across Uniswap v2, v3, and v4 in a single transaction using command-based encoding, and it integrates with <a href="/docs/protocols/permit2/overview" data-discover="true">Permit2</a> for signature-controlled token approvals.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>Are the Uniswap protocol contracts audited?</summary><div class="ms-4"><p>Yes. The Uniswap v4 <a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/tree/main/docs/security/audits" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">core audits</a> and <a href="https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-periphery/tree/main/audits" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">periphery audits</a> are published in their repositories, and Uniswap Labs maintains an active <a href="https://cantina.xyz/bounties/f9df94db-c7b1-434b-bb06-d1360abdd1be" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">bug bounty program on Cantina</a> for eligible vulnerability disclosures.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>Where do I find Uniswap contract deployment addresses?</summary><div class="ms-4"><p>The <a href="/deployments" data-discover="true">unified deployments page</a> lists Uniswap contract addresses across all protocols and chains. Each protocol section of the docs also has its own deployments page; for example, <a href="/docs/protocols/v4/deployments" data-discover="true">Uniswap v4 addresses</a> are on the v4 deployments page, and the <a href="/docs/protocols/smart-wallet/deployments" data-discover="true">smart wallet deployments page</a> lists the Calibur address across supported networks.</p></div></details></div></div><footer id="nd-docs-footer" class="relative z-10 mt-16 pb-6 border-t border-surface3 pt-6 order-last"><div class="flex justify-start flex-nowrap flex-col items-start gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-0"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-start gap-6 flex-wrap"><a class="hover:text-neutral1 transition-colors" href="/dashboard" data-discover="true"><p class="text-body-3 font-normal text-left text-neutral2">API keys</p></a><button type="button" class="text-neutral2 hover:text-neutral1 transition-colors"><p class="text-body-3 font-normal text-left text-inherit">Help</p></button><button type="button" class="text-neutral2 hover:text-neutral1 transition-colors"><p class="text-body-3 font-normal text-left text-inherit">Feedback</p></button><a href="https://statuspage.incident.io/uniswap-status" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-neutral2 hover:text-neutral1 transition-colors"><p class="text-body-3 font-normal text-left text-inherit">Status</p></a><button type="button" class="text-neutral2 hover:text-neutral1 transition-colors" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_5d9iin55_" data-state="closed"><span class="text-body-3 font-normal text-left text-inherit">Legal</span></button></div><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-start flex-nowrap gap-5"><a href="htt